        },
        {
          "text": "**Zettelkasten Method:** A practical, note-centric PKB method that naturally aligns with andragogical principles of non-linear discovery and emergent, bottom-up learning.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 119,
          "source": "topic-set_andragogical-frameworks-for-personal-knowledge-management-systems_🆔20251024061743.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Metacognition and \"Learning How to Learn\":** Explores the *awareness* of one's own learning process, a critical skill for any self-directed learner.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 121,
          "source": "topic-set_andragogical-frameworks-for-personal-knowledge-management-systems_🆔20251024061743.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Spaced Repetition Systems (SRS):** A proven cognitive science technique for knowledge retention (the \"what\") that can be integrated with the andragogical frameworks (the \"why\" and \"how\").",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 122,
          "source": "topic-set_andragogical-frameworks-for-personal-knowledge-management-systems_🆔20251024061743.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Connectivism (Siemens & Downes):** A modern learning theory for the digital age that views learning as the process of building and navigating networks—a perfect metaphor for a link-based PKB.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 123,
          "source": "topic-set_andragogical-frameworks-for-personal-knowledge-management-systems_🆔20251024061743.md"
        }
      ]
